        <item>
            <title>0.1.9</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:34:32 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Scroll follows your hand now: down is down, whatever the Mac's scroll setting. On the stepped EQ and the gain, one wheel click is one step.

A whole scroll is one undo step in Logic, not thirty.

Turn a pot and the pointer stays where you clicked it, in sight. Down is down there too.

Hover text shows up in Logic now, after five seconds. Right-click menus stay open until you pick something.

NOISE is the input plate's bottom screw. Small. Unlabelled. Hover to find out.

On LINE, the gain number stops at +18, where the gain does.

Quit Logic and this swaps itself in. Your songs come along.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://gdsteelers.github.io/412-updates/412-s2/412-S2-0.1.9-0.1.9.zip" length="5828722" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="jfedEDUKumd93DGQSQgVSBf9JVrK2dXOFQK2pJ8vqQ+sCF/8fPoX4NS1Hp+ulFdyuwggWtHB0XviHKk05pEUCg=="/>
